  "title": "Creamy Make-Ahead Mashed Potatoes",
  "description": "These make-ahead mashed potatoes can be made up to two days ahead to save you time; adding butter after reheating makes them taste freshly mashed!",
  "authors": [
    "USA WEEKEND columnist Pam Anderson"
  ],
