  "ingredients": [
    "3 pounds russet (Idaho) potatoes, scrubbed but unpeeled",
    "1.5 cups half-and-half",
    "salt to taste",
    "6 tablespoons butter, softened"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes in a large pot and cover with salted water; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until tender, about 20 minutes. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4TDCsGZ00ymKxlnwYMf1mKyldwI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/76961-creamy-make-ahead-mashed-potatoes-VAT-step-01-01d43ba0fb794920af5974ad28a782a7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/76961/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat half-and-half in the microwave until just warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pKtzgJR56lb7AbYX06hDwz-m_BU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/76961-creamy-make-ahead-mashed-potatoes-VAT-step-02-86edd6049e6e48bb9c78e4ebf28bd954.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/76961/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Process unpeeled potatoes through a food mill into a medium bowl. (Or, using a potholder, peel and drop them into a bowl. Puree using a potato masher or stand mixer fitted with the paddle attachment.) Stir in warm half-and-half and salt (or beat, if using a mixer) until smooth and fluffy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/clUgzblnDTRpfVqq8rgbLpcGZDs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/76961-creamy-make-ahead-mashed-potatoes-VAT-step-03-6c1465b521b042a1b4c677a625503eec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/76961/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool, cover, and refrigerate potatoes in a microwave-safe, airtight container for up to 2 days.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_Q4tqubhftRu7qkvUftv90zOxNI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/76961-creamy-make-ahead-mashed-potatoes-VAT-step-05-f6f89adbeada472fb3dd0ab708959bab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/76961/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thirty minutes before serving, microwave until warm. Transfer to a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water. Stir in butter to melt. Cover and keep warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VafejInv5UV3oDRPfbcrR70Sxjs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/76961-creamy-make-ahead-mashed-potatoes-VAT-step-04-7f137b50601e45529d0874f37bd0a13a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/76961/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
